---
title: "origin_resolution (stem-system auth/callback/route.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_parse_url: searchParams = new URL(request.url).searchParams
    q_parse_url --> q_extract_code: code = searchParams.get('code')
    q_extract_code --> q_read_headers: forwardedHost = headers.get('x-forwarded-host')
    q_read_headers --> q_read_proto: forwardedProto = headers.get('x-forwarded-proto')
    q_read_proto --> q_resolve_host: host = forwardedHost || headers.get('host') || 'localhost:9002'
    q_resolve_host --> q_resolve_proto: protocol = forwardedProto || 'http'
    q_resolve_proto --> [*]: origin = protocol + '://' + host

    note right of q_read_headers
        INV-001: origin is constructed from client-controllable headers (x-forwarded-host, x-forwarded-proto) without validation
        INV-002: fallback host is 'localhost:9002' when no Host header present
    end note
